      "amount": "2 tablespoons",
      "notes": "adjust to taste"
    },
    {
      "name": "Fresh cilantro",
      "amount": "1/4 cup, chopped",
      "notes": "for garnish"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "Grease a 9x9-inch baking dish with 2 tablespoons of butter.",
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine the Kenyan pilaf, yellow cheese, and morbier cheese.",
    "Stir in 2 tablespoons of soy sauce and mix well.",
    "Transfer the pilaf mixture to the prepared baking dish.",
    "Dot the top of the pilaf with the remaining 2 tablespoons of butter.",
    "Bake for 20-25 minutes or until the cheese is melted and bubbly.",
    "Garnish with chopped cilantro before serving."
